            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"本地｜東北季候風襲港 市區今跌至14度 下周中料再降溫\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/20345318f15d27cc99e59aefdd6321d86cd4233ba904bcb9dfd9a8f7bc749151/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">本地｜東北季候風襲港 市區今跌至14度 下周中料再降溫</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">天文台發出強烈季候風信號，一股強烈東北季候風正影響廣東沿岸，本港今日顯著轉涼，市區氣溫由凌晨約16度降至稍後約14度，新界再低一兩度。今日密雲有幾陣雨，離岸及高地吹強風，氣溫介乎14至20度。天文台預料下周二另一股東北季候風抵達華南沿岸，下周三本港再度轉涼。</p></div>",
